ing during dark wake while retaining compatibility fallbacks.\n\n### Shared runtime behavior\n- Include message acceptance, queue metadata, and synchronized composer draft support.","is_prerelease":false},"readme":true,"readme_zh":false,"news":[],"stale":false,"snapshot_at":"2026-11-14T08:50:43Z","history_start":"2026-09-06"}